WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.824
Today we will select colours intentionally. Our work connects with selected artists

00:00:04.824 --> 00:00:06.365
and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.120
Choose three colours that suit your chosen message. Name a design choice that a

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.877
selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.196
Test the colours in small labelled boxes.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.305
Circle the most readable combination and plan where to use it.
